- op: discuss  # 56de
  at: '2026-11-22T03:22:57Z'  # 56de
  by: agent  # 56de
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 56de
  clock: 6  # 56de
  nonce: 56de  # 56de
  message: "Closed by PR #2324. Measured time and parts are in the previous entry (lab notebook fast_smart_test_build_11172026/lutok/RESULTS.md). The cut: the generator's self-analysis now runs with '-e vendor --no-sketch-fan-out --no-handler-slices'. The analysis alone: 344.5 s / 338.7 s before, 262.2 s after, same node ids and edge triples. scripts/generate-architecture end to end with the flags: 291.7 s, rc 0, and 'generate-architecture --check' says 'generated 0 commit(s) ago'; the old script was not timed end to end under the same conditions, so the saving in script time is roughly 50 to 80 s and not known more closely (a paired rerun was started and stopped at the owner's request to move on). Why it cannot read smart-test's stored graph: graph_rows keeps node->file and (src, dst) pairs only, the rebuild deletes its survey, and its scope is the repository root at the baseline commit. Left for the owner: excluding tests gives 144 s but changes the doc's totals ('test code included'). Side finding filed: WI-navod (analyzers run on files the tier filter drops)."  # 56de
